other stuff. There's no ability to keybind to mouse; there's barely any variety in the levels (same problem with RoR2), and the RNG is so wonky that playing without the Command artefact is a waste of time.\n\nI haven't tried playing this on co-op, but you shouldn't need multiplayer to make a game fun.\n\nI wouldn't recommend this game, both because it's still 10 bucks with all the above-mentioned faults after a decade, and also because they're planning to re-release a \"remastered\" version of the game, whatever that means. Given Hopoo's inability to make non-buggy games, I would not recommend the remaster until it has been thoroughly hotfixed tho, but hey, maybe it'll have keybinding features for the mouse ...", "timestamp_created": 1675014831, "timestamp_updated": 1675014831, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.343264609575271606", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "131803147", "author": {"steamid": "76561198122191321", "personaname": "for the king", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Illatior/", "num_games_owned": 490, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1919, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1916, "last_played": 1675539430, "avatar": "d7e333667c37111e697cd89b82bc6bb6bea1d445"}, "language": "english", "review": "no rain", "timestamp_created": 1675000297, "timestamp_updated": 1675000297, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.534715652465820312", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}